3730/extras/177cdb40ad9e8f28d0b25debad91affa.avif?t=1693223812\" width=616 height=128 /></span><br>After each fight, your troops and the commander gain experience, When the new level is reached, the commander can choose a new skill, and troops can be upgraded into new forms gain new stats, and new abilities or change their behaviour, like turning the shooter into a mortar.<br><br>Depending on the chosen race, some units can have a bigger development tree for the current class.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753730/extras/76e2584f1a29158a74d7bf08af6ff934.avif?t=1693223812\" width=616 height=612 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753730/extras/026faa03d6a92dc5d5c6ee0b090b2794.avif?t=1693223812\" width=616 height=128 /></span><br>It's a fairly large project for one person, but I also want to expand it by adding new mechanics, refreshing graphics increasing the level of creepiness and trying to put some Lovecraft style (mental illness and devils in the role of ancient gods)<br><br>Online multiplayer mode coming soon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753730/extras/ec4161bfda02e8602c3247dff5fa8292.avif?t=1693223812\" width=576 height=512 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753730/extras/602df4c4ffad9e9f2b8d80fd2f130877.avif?t=1693223812\" width=680 height=312 /></span>","developers":["Omegan's Domain"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1753730/header.jpg?t=1693223812","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[]